  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {出資|しゅっし}{者|しゃ} - investor, contributor\n- {出資|しゅっし}{金|きん} - investment capital\n- {出資|しゅっし}⟦{比率|ひりつ}→比率：06727_hiritsu⟧ - investment ratio\n- ⟦{共同|きょうどう}→共同：02591_kyoudou⟧{出資|しゅっし} - joint investment\n- {出資|しゅっし}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{募|つの}る→募る：10878_tsunoru⟧ - to seek investment\n\nBUSINESS CONTEXT:\nUsed in business/corporate contexts to describe contributing capital to a company.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{投資|とうし}→投資：04711_toushi⟧ - investment (more general, includes stocks)\n- ⟦{融資|ゆうし}→融資：04775_yuushi⟧ - financing, loan (lending money)",
